 kit toolchains - lists the toolchains kit found here, and records which one to use

   one of
   *kit toolchains*  lists the toolchains kit found here, and records which one to use

     --json   --jq
                   one JSON object per row: provider, role, usable, active, chosen, and fills

   choose          records the toolchain for the project; ambient chooses none


